- **Hot spots:** `src/app/mod.rs` (A1 (`omad-m4-agent-surface-doctor-c6cm.1.1`, per-command facts in `COMMANDS`) first; each command leaf adds its own rows and rebases): three rows before `help`, one `canonical_path` arm, one dispatch arm. `src/cli.rs` (keep each hook in its own function): one variant and one help constant. `src/contract/schema.rs` and `src/contract/opaque.rs` (A3's (`omad-m4-agent-surface-doctor-c6cm.1.3`, schemas and live validation)): one type and five rows in sort order. `omarchy/Model.js` (command leaves add only `CLI_PATHS` rows). `tests/contract/matrix.rs` (append rows; one snapshot file per row). `tests/cli_skeleton.rs` and its snapshots, `src/app/help.rs`'s planned list: every command leaf touches them; rebase and re-accept, never merge snapshot text by hand. `README.md`: own section and one sentence.
