- **B1 (`omad-m4-agent-surface-doctor-c6cm.2.1`, the guide renderer and `robot-docs guide`) and B3 (`omad-m4-agent-surface-doctor-c6cm.2.3`, `robot-docs install-skill`) extend the tree.** B1 adds `Guide` and rewires the `None` arm, its `canonical_path` arm and the `robot-docs` row's `data`; B3 adds `InstallSkill` (a mutating subcommand: typo fixes for it become help, which `subcommand_fix` already does). Keep the `None` arm a single line so their diffs stay small.
